# {{ project_name }} — frontend

SvelteKit + shadcn-svelte (bun, adapter-node, Tailwind v4). Talks to the backend at `/api`.

## Pages

- `/` — landing page
- `/dashboard` — stats, a 14-day activity chart and recent items from `GET /api/dashboard` (sign-in required)
- `/items` — create and delete items (sign-in required)

## Develop

```bash
bun install
bun run dev        # proxies /api → http://localhost:8000
```

## Test

```bash
bun run test:unit   # vitest (jsdom) component/unit tests
bunx playwright install chromium   # once (`just bootstrap` does this)
bun run test:e2e    # Playwright smoke (builds + previews)
```

## Build

```bash
bun run build       # adapter-node → build/
node build          # run (set PORT / ORIGIN in production)
```

## Auth

Authentication is delegated to Keycloak via OpenID Connect (authorization code + PKCE), with the
SvelteKit server as a confidential client (`src/lib/server/oidc.ts`):

- `GET /login` redirects to Keycloak; `GET /login/callback` exchanges the code and stores the
  access/refresh/id tokens in httpOnly cookies.
- `src/hooks.server.ts` refreshes the access token before it expires and injects it as a Bearer
  header on server-side `/api` calls.
- `POST /logout` clears the cookies and ends the Keycloak session.
- `/items` is guarded and sends anonymous visitors through `/login`.

Configure with `KEYCLOAK_URL` (browser-facing), `KEYCLOAK_INTERNAL_URL` (optional, server-side),
`KEYCLOAK_REALM`, `KEYCLOAK_CLIENT_ID` and `KEYCLOAK_CLIENT_SECRET`.
